STAR AND CONSTELLATION DATA
---------------------------

The project uses star coordinates and magnitudes associated with the HYG
Database:

    https://github.com/astronexus/HYG-Database

Constellation line figures are based on the Sky & Telescope 2014 figures,
including the corresponding Stellarium sky-culture reference:

    https://github.com/Stellarium/stellarium/blob/master/skycultures/modern_st/SnT_constellations.txt

These upstream projects and datasets are separate works. Preserve their
attribution and comply with the applicable license or usage terms of the
specific versions used when redistributing related data.

MODIFIED AND CONVERTED FILES
----------------------------

The project includes PNG versions of two Earth texture files converted from
TIFF because browsers do not universally support TIFF:

* assets/textures/2k_earth_normal_map.png
* assets/textures/2k_earth_specular_map.png

The conversion is documented in assets/textures/ATTRIBUTION.txt. The project
also contains original procedural fallback textures and fictional artistic
textures identified in that file.

